      en: ["The Skjern Å restoration project was carried out between 1999 and 2003.", "The restored natural area covers approximately 2,200 hectares.", "The Skjern Å is the river with the largest volume of water in Denmark.", "More than 200 different bird species have been recorded within the delta.", "The Skjern Å salmon is known to reach weights exceeding 20 kilograms.", "A total of 26 kilometers of riverbed were restored to their original meandering shape."],
