      en: ["Tisvilde Hegn covers a total land area of approximately 1,500 hectares.", "Afforestation to combat sand drift officially commenced in the year 1724.", "The 'Troldeskoven' contains Scots pines that are over 100 years old.", "Asserbo Castle was originally founded around 1150 by Bishop Absalon.", "The village of Torup completely disappeared under the sand in the 16th century.", "The forest has been part of the National Park of Royal North Zealand since 2018."],
